{"title":"Career Roadmap · Tech Lawyer","role":"Tech Lawyer","summary":"A Tech Lawyer advises technology companies and organizations on the legal, regulatory, contractual, privacy, intellectual-property and governance issues created by digital technologies.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Technology Law / AI Governance"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Tech Lawyer advises technology companies and organizations on the legal, regulatory, contractual, privacy, intellectual-property and governance issues created by digital technologies."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Law"},{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Artificial intelligence"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Intellectual property"},{"text":"Digital business"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Corporate governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A modern Tech Lawyer may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software licensing"},{"text":"SaaS agreements"},{"text":"Cloud contracts"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"AI governance"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Technology procurement"},{"text":"Intellectual property"},{"text":"Digital platforms"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Digital payments"},{"text":"Emerging technologies"},{"text":"Technology disputes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is a lawyer who can understand technology sufficiently to identify its legal implications, rather than relying only on traditional legal knowledge."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB","Technology Law + IP + Data + Cyber Law","Technology Legal Internship","Legal Associate / Technology Law Analyst","Tech Lawyer","Senior Technology Lawyer","Technology 