,{"text":"Build a basic regulatory tracker"},{"text":"Use Excel and Power BI"},{"text":"Use AI responsibly for legal research"},{"text":"Communicate with engineers, product managers and business teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology Legal Research Paper"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SaaS Contract Review"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI Governance Framework"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Privacy Impact Assessment"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI Vendor Due-Diligence Framework"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Technology Regulatory Tracker"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Open-Source Licensing Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"2–3 Technology-Law Internships"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TECHNOLOGY LAW"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CONTRACT LAW"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"DATA PROTECTION & PRIVACY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CYBER LAW"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI GOVERNANCE"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"TECHNOLOGY CONTRACTS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LEGAL RESEARCH"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"TECHNOLOGY LITERACY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LEGAL RISK MANAGEMENT"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"EXCEL + DATA ANALYTICS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI-ASSISTED LEGAL RESEARCH"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"BUSINESS COMMUNICATION"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for this career is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Technology lawyer specializing in technology transactions, data protection, cybersecurity, intellectual property and AI governance.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The most valuable combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Technology Understanding","Contracts","Privacy","IP","Cybersecurity","AI Governance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A student who develops this combination can work not only in traditional technology-law practices but also within technology companies, FinTechs, SaaS businesses, AI companies, consulting organizations, legal-tech companies and corporate legal departments."},{"type":"h","text":"Career-Fitment Mapping Note"},{"type":"p","text":"Tech Lawyer is a broad career title rather than a single regulated specialization. A student can enter through technology transactions, privacy, cyber law, IP, digital regulation or AI governance. For a future-facing profile, AI governance + data protection + technology contracts is particularly strong because it combines legal analysis with the governance requirements emerging around enterprise AI and digital technologies. For actual legal practice, the student must satisfy the applicable professional enrolment and practice requirements in the relevant jurisdiction."}]}]}